  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ricemmkg#Medium_Severity">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ricemmkg#SeverityLevel"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Medium Severity</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Corresponds to the attack-intensity category sedang (moderate) of Direktorat Jenderal Tanaman Pangan (2021), Petunjuk Teknis Pengamatan dan Pelaporan OPT dan DPI, Kepdirjen TP No. 127/HK.310/C/5/2021: above 10% up to 25% for diseases, above 25% up to 50% for pests. The guideline defines the bands; the correspondence to this level is a modelling choice.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
