    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/ricemmkg#SeverityLevel"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Low Severity</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Corresponds to the attack-intensity category ringan (light) of Direktorat Jenderal Tanaman Pangan (2021), Petunjuk Teknis Pengamatan dan Pelaporan OPT dan DPI, Kepdirjen TP No. 127/HK.310/C/5/2021: above the control threshold (AP) up to 10% for diseases, up to 25% for pests. The guideline defines the bands; the correspondence to this level is a modelling choice.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
