    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">AGROVOC prefLabel for c_16025 is "Pyricularia oryzae" (the anamorph name); "Magnaporthe oryzae" (teleomorph name) is listed as a skos:altLabel on the same concept, so this is the same fungal species under AGROVOC's dual nomenclature.</rdfs:comment>
