  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/ricemmkg#SeverityLevel">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A categorical grading of how severe an observed condition is. The four levels correspond to the attack-intensity categories of the Indonesian pest-observation guideline (Direktorat Jenderal Tanaman Pangan (2021), Petunjuk Teknis Pengamatan dan Pelaporan OPT dan DPI, Kepdirjen TP No. 127/HK.310/C/5/2021): ringan, sedang, berat and puso. The guideline maps no category to a management action, so none is asserted.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Severity Level</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
