    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation xml:lang="en">Mackill, D.J. &amp; Khush, G.S. (2018). IR64: a high-quality and high-yielding mega variety. Rice, 11, 18. https://doi.org/10.1186/s12284-018-0208-3 (accessed 2026-09-16).</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
